.TH SIGMA-PKG 1 "May 2024" "SigmaOS 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sigma-pkg \- Universal content-addressed package manager for SigmaOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sigma-pkg
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIPACKAGE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sigma-pkg
is the primary package manager for SigmaOS. It provides atomic, reproducible
installations, content-addressed storage (CAS) rollbacks, and multi-format adapters
for 18 major distribution formats (Debian, RPM, Pacman, Alpine, Nix, Flatpak, etc.).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B install \fIPACKAGE\fR
Install \fIPACKAGE\fR with automatic dependency resolution and capability sandboxing.
.TP
.B remove \fIPACKAGE\fR
Remove \fIPACKAGE\fR and unneeded dependencies.
.TP
.B rollback \fICHECKPOINT_ID\fR
Atomically rollback system state to \fICHECKPOINT_ID\fR.
.TP
.B search \fIQUERY\fR
Search available package repositories for \fIQUERY\fR.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sigma-sh (1)
